          <div class="eyebrow">Fall merch — for gym owners</div>
          <h1>Longsleeves. Light hoodies. <span class="accent">3/4 raglans.</span></h1>
          <p class="hero-lede">Fall is not a tee season. When September and October weather turns, members want layers they will actually wear after class and into cooler training blocks. Forever Fierce designs the art free, your members preorder, and we print and ship—no inventory buy, no art fees, free sizing samples.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
