          </div>
          <div class="hero-meta"><span>Timed to Sept / Oct weather</span><span>Free design</span><span>Free sizing samples</span><span>Zero inventory risk</span></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="side-card reveal">
          <h2>Fall lineup that sells</h2>
          <p>Keep the assortment tight. Three silhouettes cover cool-weather demand without choice overload.</p>
          <ul class="side-list">
            <li>Longsleeve tees — everyday layer volume</li>
            <li>Lightweight hoodies — higher ticket, strong margin</li>
            <li>3/4 sleeve raglans — training + lifestyle hybrid</li>
            <li>Launch when weather actually changes</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

