        <span>17 Years <em>‣‣</em> 5,000+ Gyms Served <em>‣‣</em> 30,000+ Orders <em>‣‣</em> 90%+ Repeat Rate <em>‣‣</em> 1.8M Shirts Printed <em>‣‣</em></span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">17 Years <em>‣‣</em> 5,000+ Gyms Served <em>‣‣</em> 30,000+ Orders <em>‣‣</em> 90%+ Repeat Rate <em>‣‣</em> 1.8M Shirts Printed <em>‣‣</em></span>
