    <section class="ideas" id="mockups">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="ideas-head">
          <div class="reveal">
            <div class="eyebrow">3 fall mockups</div>
            <h2 class="section-title">React to a direction. <span class="accent">Or go fully custom.</span></h2>
          </div>
          <p class="section-copy reveal">Three mockup slots—drop real art when ready. Pick one to adapt for your gym, or start from a blank brief. Either path includes free design support from Forever Fierce.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ideas-grid">
          <article class="idea reveal"><div class="idea-art"><span>Mockup 01<br>Fall concept</span></div><div class="idea-body"><h3>Mockup 01</h3><p>Primary fall direction—built for longsleeve volume and everyday wear once temperatures drop.</p><span class="idea-tag">Longsleeve</span></div></article>
          <article class="idea reveal"><div class="idea-art"><span>Mockup 02<br>Fall concept</span></div><div class="idea-body"><h3>Mockup 02</h3><p>Layer-forward concept for lightweight hoodies—higher ticket when the first cool weeks hit.</p><span class="idea-tag">Lightweight hoodie</span></div></article>
          <article class="idea reveal"><div class="idea-art"><span>Mockup 03<br>Fall concept</span></div><div class="idea-body"><h3>Mockup 03</h3><p>Raglan-friendly training graphic for transitional September/October weather.</p><span class="idea-tag">3/4 raglan</span></div></article>
        </div>
        <div class="mech-line reveal">Pick a direction or go custom · free design · members preorder · we print &amp; ship</div>
