        <h2 class="section-title reveal">Design free. Members preorder. <span class="accent">We run production.</span></h2>
        <div class="how-grid">
          <article class="how-step reveal"><div class="how-num">01</div><h3>We design it free</h3><p>Start from one of three fall mockups or go custom. Our team builds art around your brand, members, and season. No art fees.</p></article>
          <article class="how-step reveal"><div class="how-num">02</div><h3>Members preorder</h3><p>We set up a branded store, ship free sizing samples, and you share the link. Members buy the right size before we print.</p></article>
